{"canonical_story_id":"i-wrote-my-family-that-i-love-them-and-that-i-m-happy-with-the-life-i-ve-had","default_language":"en","available_languages":["en","es","fr","ja","pt"],"witness_name":"Millet B.'s story","category_id":"nova-festival","publication_date":"2023-10-14T08:52:24.653Z","cover_media_id":"img-36494782913662b1","translation_status":"partial","source_urls":{"pt":"https://www.october7.org/pt/post/as-pessoas-do-festival-estavam-sendo-mortas-ou-sequestradas-e-não-tínhamos-para-onde-ir","en":"https://www.october7.org/post/i-wrote-my-family-that-i-love-them-and-that-i-m-happy-with-the-life-i-ve-had","fr":"https://www.october7.org/fr/post/j-ai-écrit-à-ma-famille-que-je-les-aimais-et-que-j-étais-heureuse-de-la-vie-que-j-avais-eue","es":"https://www.october7.org/es/post/le-escribí-a-mi-familia-diciéndole-que-los-amaba-y-que-estaba-feliz-con-la-vida-que-había-tenido","ja":"https://www.october7.org/ja/post/「私の人生は幸せだった、愛している」と家族にメッセージしたわ。"},"versions":{"pt":{"story_id":"as-pessoas-do-festival-estavam-sendo-mortas-ou-sequestradas-e-não-tínhamos-para-pt","locale":"pt","direction":"ltr","slug":"as-pessoas-do-festival-estavam-sendo-mortas-ou-sequestradas-e-não-tínhamos-para","title":"As pessoas do festival estavam sendo mortas ou sequestradas, e não tínhamos para onde ir","witness_name":"Millet B.'s story","publication_date":"2023-11-28T09:24:12.203Z","category_id":"nova-festival","excerpt":"As pessoas do festival estavam sendo mortas ou sequestradas, e não tínhamos para onde ir and additional eyewitness accounts from October 7 massacre","full_text":"7 de outubro\n>\nfestival de música nova\n>\nAs pessoas do festival estavam sendo mortas ou sequestradas, e não tínhamos para onde ir\n\nNo meio do festival foguetes começaram a cobrir o céu, e entendemos que teríamos de correr.\n\nQuase todos estavam “chapados”.Peguei as chaves do carro de alguém, que tinha recém encontrado, e comecei a dirigir feito louco, tentando escapar.\n\nEscutamos tiros vindos de todas as direções.\n\nAs pessoas do festival estavam sendo mortas ou sequestradas, e não tínhamos para onde ir. Tivemos que sair do carro e correr por 3 horas, mas os terroristas estavam em toda parte.\n\nMillet B.","cover_media_id":"img-36494782913662b1","cover_status":"ok","media_ids":["vid-c6800ce7d24f6d7a","vid-576618f69ddbbf82","vid-6674ac38c80761b4","img-2bd8fa9a1d5f0883","img-36494782913662b1","vid-b038e73510cb45bf","vid-4979ecec0163fdbb"],"source_url":"https://www.october7.org/pt/post/as-pessoas-do-festival-estavam-sendo-mortas-ou-sequestradas-e-não-tínhamos-para-onde-ir","original_slug":"as-pessoas-do-festival-estavam-sendo-mortas-ou-sequestradas-e-não-tínhamos-para","attribution":"Millet B.'s story","content_warning":null,"status":"published","legacy_id":"as-pessoas-do-festival-estavam-sendo-mortas-ou-sequestradas-e-não-tínhamos-para-pt","content_blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"7 de outubro\n>\nfestival de música nova\n>\nAs pessoas do festival estavam sendo mortas ou sequestradas, e não tínhamos para onde ir"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No meio do festival foguetes começaram a cobrir o céu, e entendemos que teríamos de correr."},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-c6800ce7d24f6d7a"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-576618f69ddbbf82"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-6674ac38c80761b4"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Quase todos estavam “chapados”.Peguei as chaves do carro de alguém, que tinha recém encontrado, e comecei a dirigir feito louco, tentando escapar."},{"type":"image","media_id":"img-2bd8fa9a1d5f0883"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Escutamos tiros vindos de todas as direções."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"As pessoas do festival estavam sendo mortas ou sequestradas, e não tínhamos para onde ir. Tivemos que sair do carro e correr por 3 horas, mas os terroristas estavam em toda parte."},{"type":"image","media_id":"img-36494782913662b1"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-b038e73510cb45bf"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-4979ecec0163fdbb"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Millet B."}],"files":{"story_md":"pt/story.md","content_json":"pt/content.json"}},"en":{"story_id":"i-wrote-my-family-that-i-love-them-and-that-i-m-happy-with-the-life-i-ve-had-en","locale":"en","direction":"ltr","slug":"i-wrote-my-family-that-i-love-them-and-that-i-m-happy-with-the-life-i-ve-had","title":"I wrote my family that I love them and that I'm happy with the life I've had","witness_name":"Millet B.'s story","publication_date":"2023-10-14T08:52:24.653Z","category_id":"nova-festival","excerpt":"Millet BIn the middle of the party, rockets started covering the sky and we realized we have to run.Almost everyone was really waisted.I took the car keys from someone I just met and started driving like crazy, trying to escape. We heard shootings in every direction, people at the party were getting killed or kidnapped, we didn’t know where to go. We had to get out of the car and ran for 3 hours, but terrorists were everywhere.I felt weak and scared and c","full_text":"October 7\n>\nNova Festival\n> Testimony of Millet B\n\nIn the middle of the party, rockets started covering the sky and we realized we have to run.\n\nAlmost everyone was really waisted.\n\nI took the car keys from someone I just met and started driving like crazy, trying to escape.\n\nWe heard shootings in every direction, people at the party were getting killed or kidnapped, we didn’t know where to go. We had to get out of the car and ran for 3 hours, but terrorists were everywhere.\n\nI felt weak and scared and couldn’t run anymore so we hid under a tree, covering ourselves with leafs. We called the police and they said they couldn’t help us, we are on our own.\n\nAt that point I was sure that I will not make it alive and I wrote my family that I love them and I’m happy with the life I’ve had.\n\nWe tried to breath quietly without crying because terrorists were still shouting everywhere.\n\nEventually we sent a video to a friend who was driving around and tried to find us, with 2% phone battery we heard his car honking and crawled towards his car. This angel saved us.\n\nMillet B.","cover_media_id":"img-36494782913662b1","cover_status":"ok","media_ids":["vid-c6800ce7d24f6d7a","vid-576618f69ddbbf82","vid-6674ac38c80761b4","img-2bd8fa9a1d5f0883","img-36494782913662b1","vid-b038e73510cb45bf","vid-4979ecec0163fdbb"],"source_url":"https://www.october7.org/post/i-wrote-my-family-that-i-love-them-and-that-i-m-happy-with-the-life-i-ve-had","original_slug":"i-wrote-my-family-that-i-love-them-and-that-i-m-happy-with-the-life-i-ve-had","attribution":"Millet B.'s story","content_warning":null,"status":"published","legacy_id":"i-wrote-my-family-that-i-love-them-and-that-i-m-happy-with-the-life-i-ve-had-en","content_blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"October 7\n>\nNova Festival\n> Testimony of Millet B"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"In the middle of the party, rockets started covering the sky and we realized we have to run."},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-c6800ce7d24f6d7a"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-576618f69ddbbf82"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-6674ac38c80761b4"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Almost everyone was really waisted."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"I took the car keys from someone I just met and started driving like crazy, trying to escape."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"We heard shootings in every direction, people at the party were getting killed or kidnapped, we didn’t know where to go. We had to get out of the car and ran for 3 hours, but terrorists were everywhere."},{"type":"image","media_id":"img-2bd8fa9a1d5f0883"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"I felt weak and scared and couldn’t run anymore so we hid under a tree, covering ourselves with leafs. We called the police and they said they couldn’t help us, we are on our own."},{"type":"image","media_id":"img-36494782913662b1"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-b038e73510cb45bf"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"At that point I was sure that I will not make it alive and I wrote my family that I love them and I’m happy with the life I’ve had."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"We tried to breath quietly without crying because terrorists were still shouting everywhere."},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-4979ecec0163fdbb"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Eventually we sent a video to a friend who was driving around and tried to find us, with 2% phone battery we heard his car honking and crawled towards his car. This angel saved us."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Millet B."}],"files":{"story_md":"en/story.md","content_json":"en/content.json"}},"fr":{"story_id":"j-ai-écrit-à-ma-famille-que-je-les-aimais-et-que-j-étais-heureuse-de-la-vie-que-fr","locale":"fr","direction":"ltr","slug":"j-ai-écrit-à-ma-famille-que-je-les-aimais-et-que-j-étais-heureuse-de-la-vie-que","title":"J’ai écrit à ma famille que je les aimais et que j’étais heureuse de la vie que j’avais eue","witness_name":"Millet B.'s story","publication_date":"2023-10-29T16:02:12.303Z","category_id":"nova-festival","excerpt":"J’ai écrit à ma famille que je les aimais et que j’étais heureuse de la vie que j’avais eue and additional eyewitness accounts from October 7 massacre","full_text":"October 7\n>\nFestival Nova\n> J’ai écrit à ma famille que je les aimais et que j’étais heureuse de la vie que j’avais eue\n\nEn plein milieu de la fête, des roquettes ont commencé à envahir le ciel et nous avons compris que nous devions fuir.\n\nOn planait presque tous. J’ai pris les clés de voiture de quelqu’un que je venais de rencontrer et j’ai commencé à conduire comme une folle pour essayer de nous enfuir.\n\n## À ce moment-là, j’étais convaincue que je ne survivrai pas, et j’ai écrit à ma famille que je les aimais et que j’étais heureuse de la vie que j’avais eue.\n\nDes tirs résonnaient dans toutes les directions. Les participants de la fête se faisaient soit tuer soit kidnapper, on ne savait pas où aller. Nous avons dû sortir de la voiture et nous avons couru pendant 3 heures, mais il y avait des terroristes partout.\n\nJe me sentais faible et effrayée, et je ne pouvais plus courir, alors nous nous sommes cachés sous un arbre en nous couvrant de feuilles.\n\nOn a appelé la police mais ils nous ont répondu qu’ils ne pouvaient rien faire pour nous, nous étions livrés à nous-mêmes.\n\nÀ ce moment-là, j’étais convaincue que je ne survivrai pas, et j’ai écrit à ma famille que je les aimais et que j’étais heureuse de la vie que j’avais eue.\n\nNous avons essayé de respirer en faisant le moins de bruit possible, sans pleurer, parce que les terroristes étaient toujours en train de crier de partout.\n\nAvec nos derniers 2 % de batterie de téléphone, nous avons réussi à envoyer une vidéo à un ami qui nous cherchait en voiture dans les environs. Nous l’avons entendu klaxonner et nous avons rampé jusqu’à sa voiture.\n\nCet ange nous a sauvés.\n\nMillet B.","cover_media_id":"img-36494782913662b1","cover_status":"ok","media_ids":["vid-c6800ce7d24f6d7a","vid-576618f69ddbbf82","vid-6674ac38c80761b4","img-2bd8fa9a1d5f0883","img-36494782913662b1","vid-b038e73510cb45bf","vid-4979ecec0163fdbb"],"source_url":"https://www.october7.org/fr/post/j-ai-écrit-à-ma-famille-que-je-les-aimais-et-que-j-étais-heureuse-de-la-vie-que-j-avais-eue","original_slug":"j-ai-écrit-à-ma-famille-que-je-les-aimais-et-que-j-étais-heureuse-de-la-vie-que","attribution":"Millet B.'s story","content_warning":null,"status":"published","legacy_id":"j-ai-écrit-à-ma-famille-que-je-les-aimais-et-que-j-étais-heureuse-de-la-vie-que-fr","content_blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"October 7\n>\nFestival Nova\n> J’ai écrit à ma famille que je les aimais et que j’étais heureuse de la vie que j’avais eue"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"En plein milieu de la fête, des roquettes ont commencé à envahir le ciel et nous avons compris que nous devions fuir."},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-c6800ce7d24f6d7a"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-576618f69ddbbf82"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-6674ac38c80761b4"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"On planait presque tous. J’ai pris les clés de voiture de quelqu’un que je venais de rencontrer et j’ai commencé à conduire comme une folle pour essayer de nous enfuir."},{"type":"heading","text":"À ce moment-là, j’étais convaincue que je ne survivrai pas, et j’ai écrit à ma famille que je les aimais et que j’étais heureuse de la vie que j’avais eue."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Des tirs résonnaient dans toutes les directions. Les participants de la fête se faisaient soit tuer soit kidnapper, on ne savait pas où aller. Nous avons dû sortir de la voiture et nous avons couru pendant 3 heures, mais il y avait des terroristes partout."},{"type":"image","media_id":"img-2bd8fa9a1d5f0883"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Je me sentais faible et effrayée, et je ne pouvais plus courir, alors nous nous sommes cachés sous un arbre en nous couvrant de feuilles."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"On a appelé la police mais ils nous ont répondu qu’ils ne pouvaient rien faire pour nous, nous étions livrés à nous-mêmes."},{"type":"image","media_id":"img-36494782913662b1"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-b038e73510cb45bf"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"À ce moment-là, j’étais convaincue que je ne survivrai pas, et j’ai écrit à ma famille que je les aimais et que j’étais heureuse de la vie que j’avais eue."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Nous avons essayé de respirer en faisant le moins de bruit possible, sans pleurer, parce que les terroristes étaient toujours en train de crier de partout."},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-4979ecec0163fdbb"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Avec nos derniers 2 % de batterie de téléphone, nous avons réussi à envoyer une vidéo à un ami qui nous cherchait en voiture dans les environs. Nous l’avons entendu klaxonner et nous avons rampé jusqu’à sa voiture."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Cet ange nous a sauvés."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Millet B."}],"files":{"story_md":"fr/story.md","content_json":"fr/content.json"}},"es":{"story_id":"le-escribí-a-mi-familia-diciéndole-que-los-amaba-y-que-estaba-feliz-con-la-vida-es","locale":"es","direction":"ltr","slug":"le-escribí-a-mi-familia-diciéndole-que-los-amaba-y-que-estaba-feliz-con-la-vida","title":"Le escribí a mi familia, diciéndole que los amaba y que estaba feliz con la vida que había tenido","witness_name":"Millet B.'s story","publication_date":"2023-10-23T14:32:54.513Z","category_id":"nova-festival","excerpt":"Le escribí a mi familia, diciéndole que los amaba y que estaba feliz con la vida que había tenido and additional eyewitness accounts from October 7 massacre","full_text":"October 7\n>\nFestival Nova\n> Le escribí a mi familia, diciéndole que los amaba y que estaba feliz con la vida que había tenido\n\nEn plena fiesta, los cohetes empezaron a cubrir el cielo y nos dimos cuenta de que teníamos que correr.\n\nCasi todos estaban pasados de alcohol.\n\nLe quité las llaves del auto a alguien que acababa de conocer y comencé a conducir como loca, tratando de escapar.\n\nEscuchamos tiroteos en todas direcciones. Mataban o secuestraban a la gente que estaba en la fiesta. No sabíamos adónde ir. Tuvimos que salir del auto y correr durante tres horas, pero había terroristas por todas partes.\n\nEstaba débil y asustada y no podía correr más, así que nos escondimos debajo de un árbol, cubriéndonos con hojas. Llamamos a la policía y nos dijeron que no podían ayudarnos, que estábamos solas.\n\nEn ese momento estaba segura de que no sobreviviría. Le escribí a mi familia, diciéndole que los amaba y que estaba feliz con la vida que había tenido.\n\nIntentamos respirar en silencio, sin llorar, porque los terroristas seguían gritando por todas partes.\n\nFinalmente, le enviamos un video a un amigo que estaba conduciendo por la zona y trató de encontrarnos, con 2% de batería en el teléfono escuchamos la bocina y nos arrastramos hacia su auto. Él fue nuestro ángel guardián que nos salvó.\n\nMillet B.","cover_media_id":"img-36494782913662b1","cover_status":"ok","media_ids":["vid-c6800ce7d24f6d7a","vid-576618f69ddbbf82","vid-6674ac38c80761b4","img-2bd8fa9a1d5f0883","img-36494782913662b1","vid-b038e73510cb45bf","vid-4979ecec0163fdbb"],"source_url":"https://www.october7.org/es/post/le-escribí-a-mi-familia-diciéndole-que-los-amaba-y-que-estaba-feliz-con-la-vida-que-había-tenido","original_slug":"le-escribí-a-mi-familia-diciéndole-que-los-amaba-y-que-estaba-feliz-con-la-vida","attribution":"Millet B.'s story","content_warning":null,"status":"published","legacy_id":"le-escribí-a-mi-familia-diciéndole-que-los-amaba-y-que-estaba-feliz-con-la-vida-es","content_blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"October 7\n>\nFestival Nova\n> Le escribí a mi familia, diciéndole que los amaba y que estaba feliz con la vida que había tenido"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-c6800ce7d24f6d7a"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-576618f69ddbbf82"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-6674ac38c80761b4"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"En plena fiesta, los cohetes empezaron a cubrir el cielo y nos dimos cuenta de que teníamos que correr."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Casi todos estaban pasados de alcohol."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Le quité las llaves del auto a alguien que acababa de conocer y comencé a conducir como loca, tratando de escapar."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Escuchamos tiroteos en todas direcciones. Mataban o secuestraban a la gente que estaba en la fiesta. No sabíamos adónde ir. Tuvimos que salir del auto y correr durante tres horas, pero había terroristas por todas partes."},{"type":"image","media_id":"img-2bd8fa9a1d5f0883"},{"type":"image","media_id":"img-36494782913662b1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Estaba débil y asustada y no podía correr más, así que nos escondimos debajo de un árbol, cubriéndonos con hojas. Llamamos a la policía y nos dijeron que no podían ayudarnos, que estábamos solas."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"En ese momento estaba segura de que no sobreviviría. Le escribí a mi familia, diciéndole que los amaba y que estaba feliz con la vida que había tenido."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Intentamos respirar en silencio, sin llorar, porque los terroristas seguían gritando por todas partes."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Finalmente, le enviamos un video a un amigo que estaba conduciendo por la zona y trató de encontrarnos, con 2% de batería en el teléfono escuchamos la bocina y nos arrastramos hacia su auto. Él fue nuestro ángel guardián que nos salvó."},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-b038e73510cb45bf"},{"type":"video","media_id":"vid-4979ecec0163fdbb"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Millet B."}],"files":{"story_md":"es/story.md","content_json":"es/content.json"}},"ja":{"story_id":"私の人生は幸せだった-愛している-と家族にメッセージしたわ-ja","locale":"ja","direction":"ltr","slug":"私の人生は幸せだった-愛している-と家族にメッセージしたわ","title":"「私の人生は幸せだった、愛している」と家族にメッセージしたわ。","witness_name":"Millet B.'s story","publication_date":"2023-10-22T11:53:19.312Z","category_id":"nova-festival","excerpt":"パーティの最中、空がロケットでいっぱいになって、走らなくちゃ！って気づいたの。ほとんど皆、何をどうしたらいいのかわからなかった。その場にいた人から車のカギをもらって、とにかく逃げるためにひたすら走ったの。どっちを向いても銃声が鳴り響き、パーティーに出てた人たちは殺され、誘拐されて行った。もうどこに逃げたらいいのかもわからなくて、私たちは車を降りて３時間走り続けたけど、テロリストがいたるところにいたの。怖くて怖くて、足もガクガクして走れなくなったから、木の下に横たわり、葉っぱで自分たちを隠そうとしたの。警察を呼んだけど、助けられないって言われたわ。もう自分たちしかいないってわかった。この時点で、私はもうだめだと思った。だから家族に、「私の人生は幸せだった、愛している」とメッセージを送ったわ。テロリストの叫び声がまだあちこちで聞こえたので、私たちは泣かないようにして息をひそめていたの。最終的に、私たちを探しに車で走り回っていた友達に自分たちのビデオを送って、（その時すでに携帯の充電は２％だったんだけど、、）そしたら彼の車のクラクションが聞こえて、私たちは何とか彼の車まで這って行ったの。彼は","full_text":"パーティの最中、空がロケットでいっぱいになって、走らなくちゃ！って気づいたの。\n\nほとんど皆、何をどうしたらいいのかわからなかった。その場にいた人から車のカギをもらって、とにかく逃げるためにひたすら走ったの。\n\nどっちを向いても銃声が鳴り響き、パーティーに出てた人たちは殺され、誘拐されて行った。もうどこに逃げたらいいのかもわからなくて、私たちは車を降りて３時間走り続けたけど、テロリストがいたるところにいたの。\n\n怖くて怖くて、足もガクガクして走れなくなったから、木の下に横たわり、葉っぱで自分たちを隠そうとしたの。警察を呼んだけど、助けられないって言われたわ。もう自分たちしかいないってわかった。\n\nこの時点で、私はもうだめだと思った。だから家族に、「私の人生は幸せだった、愛している」とメッセージを送ったわ。\n\nテロリストの叫び声がまだあちこちで聞こえたので、私たちは泣かないようにして息をひそめていたの。\n\n最終的に、私たちを探しに車で走り回っていた友達に自分たちのビデオを送って、（その時すでに携帯の充電は２％だったんだけど、、）そしたら彼の車のクラクションが聞こえて、私たちは何とか彼の車まで這って行ったの。彼は私たちにとっては天使のような存在だったわ。\n\nMillet B","cover_media_id":"img-36494782913662b1","cover_status":"ok","media_i